      "proposal/logs/smoke_gray/gray_run_manifest.json and gray_folds.csv: the 11:55:29 run has 64 triads per fold, with every offset configuration spanning folds. proposal/logs/smoke_gray_config/ records the 12:02:35 run with configurations grouped and 60/65 triads per fold.",
      "proposal/analysis_plan.md:190-204 describes triad folds/resampling; proposal/attempts_log.md:6-19 places configuration-disjoint implementation in a pre-fit audit but does not resolve the archived split transition or provide the earlier hashed plan."
